full-query: "Your company currently has a set of EC2 Instances running a web application which sits behind an Elastic Load Balancer. You also have an Amazon RDS instance which is used by the web application. You have been asked to ensure that this architecture is self healing in nature and cost effective. Which of the following would fulfill this requirement. Choose 2 answers from the option given below."
